  "title": "Pecan Pie Cobbler",
  "description": "This easy pecan pie cobbler recipe has a sweet and tender homemade cake topping with gooey caramelized pecans underneath. It has all the pecan pie flavor.",
  "authors": [
    "Jim Schiffman"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-07-20T06:20:19-04:00",
